// The lobby screen `voltra_core::lobby::LobbyScreen` opens: a name, Host,
// Find on LAN (a list of the servers found), Join by address; then, in a
// lobby, its players, a Ready toggle, Start (the host's) and Leave. The
// code finds each part by its name and stamps a copy of `Server row` per
// server found and of `Player row` per player; restyle anything, keep the
// names.
